1844+ 77E7 CB 3F            srl  a
1845+ 77E9 CB 3F            srl  a
1846+ 77EB CB 3F            srl  a
1847+ 77ED CB 3F            srl  a                  ; Sposta i 4 bit superiori in quelli inferiori (GGGG)
1848+ 77EF 32 0A EB         ld   (room_gravity_preset), a
